{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/extras/wishli__1_.gif?t=1746013765\" /><strong></strong><br><strong>Gamer Stop Simulator \u2013 Passion, Pixels, and Profit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Gamer Stop Simulator</i>, you step into the dusty aisles of a forgotten shop with nothing but a small collection of old games, limited cash, and a passion for gaming. From humble beginnings, you\u2019ll build and manage your very own video game store buying, fixing, pricing, and selling everything from retro classics to rare collectibles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/extras/ezgif-7a98cb0629c752.gif?t=1746013765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GROW FROM LOCAL NOBODY TO LEGENDARY SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host garage sales, take part in collector events, and decide your store\u2019s future: will it be a massive marketplace, or a boutique museum of gaming history?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INTERACT WITH UNIQUE CUSTOMERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal with collectors, bargain hunters, and nostalgic gamers. Some just want a cheap game, others bring in boxes of hidden gems for you to inspect. Negotiate hard or miss out on rare finds.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/extras/ezgif-7296444f4a0ead.gif?t=1746013765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REPAIR &amp; DIAGNOSE SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your diagnostic tools to find and fix hardware issues. As your skills grow, you\u2019ll identify deeper problems, lower repair costs, and boost resale value. Everything from cosmetic damage to deep internal failures awaits your expertise.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/extras/ezgif-7a60412df2b7a6.gif?t=1746013765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGE YOUR SHOP LIKE A PRO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open and close your store manually. Clean, organize, and decorate your space to attract more customers. Expand your business, unlock new areas like repair zones or testing stations, and customize your store layout.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/extras/ezgif-718109dce8988a.gif?t=1746013765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ACTIVE OR IDLE \u2014 YOUR CHOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer hands-on retail gameplay or earning passive income through online sales and rentals, Gamer Stop Simulator supports your style. Just don\u2019t neglect your store\u2014dusty shelves and unhappy customers mean bad reviews and lost revenue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory and Product Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customer Interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiation and Pricing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repair and Testing Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Financial Operations and Expense Tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decoration and Store Expansion</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to Your Wishlist Now and Be Among the First to Play!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499220?t=1746013765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/33d2d486a87699418b96f0cdcdb8f1a67d625ec1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746013765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499220/58944b46c24f651a32800351a1c99230ef87db70/ca